      "message": "fix(ui): collect the modal-dialog wait at the ui phase too; drop 'furniture' from user text\n\nPanels open file dialogs while drawing, after the one-per-frame take, so a\n30 s browse logged a slow ui frame and excused the next frame. Collect the\nwait before the ui mark; excuse is clamped so stamps never pass now.\nReword the user-facing 'furniture' messages.\n\nRefs #872\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
